<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/15th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Treaty · Peace</p><h1 class="enc-title">Treaty of Vordingborg</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1435">1435</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/15th-century">15th century</a> · Also known as Peace of Vordingborg</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Treaty of Vordingborg of 1435 ended the war between <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/eric-of-pomerania">Eric of Pomerania</a>, king of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kalmar-union">Kalmar Union</a>, and the Wendish towns of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hanseatic-league">Hanseatic League</a> that had begun in 1426. The towns kept their trading privileges in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/denmark">Denmark</a> and their exemption from <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/oresund">the Sound</a> Dues, and the costly war weakened Eric, who was deposed a few years later.</p></div>
